<node id="11106476" title="Re^5: Running JavaScript from within Perl (or just use the API)" created="2019-09-21 08:37:56" updated="2019-09-21 08:37:56" _doctext_mode="strict"><type id="11">note</type>
<author id="830549">haukex</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;c&gt;my $feedurl = $ua-&gt;get($url)-&gt;result-&gt;json-&gt;{feeds.meta.links.feed};&lt;/c&gt; which gave error message: &lt;c&gt;Bareword "feeds" not allowed while "strict subs" in use&lt;/c&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only very simple barewords are automatically quoted in &lt;c&gt;$hash{...}&lt;/c&gt; keys, the &lt;c&gt;.&lt;/c&gt; is seen as an operator here. Try &lt;c&gt;...-&gt;json-&gt;{'feeds.meta.links.feed'};&lt;/c&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Update:&lt;/i&gt; See [id://1191596].&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
